Let party members be told whom to attack, as sfall's metarule3(999) does

In combat a party member's action menu has sfall's order to attack (actioni.frm over talk): the pointer then picks a foe it can see and get to, lit red, and the party member goes for that one on its turns until the fight is over. gl_partycontrol turns it on with CombatControl Mode=3, as Fallout Et Tu and Fallout Yesterday have it.
